
Package: slurm-smd-contribs
Architecture: all
Depends:
 slurm-smd-client (= ${source:Version}),
 slurm-smd-libslurm-perl (= ${source:Version}),
 openssh-client,
 ${perl:Depends},
 ${misc:Depends}
Description: Slurm contributed command-line tools
 Job efficiency reports (seff), accounting details in notification mail (smail),
 job exit code management (sjobexitmod), job summaries (sjstat), and remote
 file gathering (sgather).
